      "text": "Entities and attributes:\n1> User : Name , email , ph no , Current location, \n2> Theater: location , name , List Screens \n3> Screen: movie , time ,duration , List[Seats] \n4> Seats: price , Seat_type \n5> Seat_Type (ENUM) \n\n\n\ntheater on the basis of geolocation which is map \nand user search will be at some radious only \nso Map<(Double, Double),Theater> Geolocation_theater = new Hashmap<>);\n",
